{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122510","id":4299576896,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAEZWQA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122510","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122510.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122510.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122510","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122510/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122510/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122510/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fe27ded36f765135f2bd1aebcfc97ae8bc182f51","number":122510,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Make possible to manipulate `CanvasItem`s in the Game view","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Implements the 2D side of https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15300.\r\n- Closes #96576.\r\n\r\nAfter lots of work throughout weeks, I proudly present: runtime manipulation of `CanvasItem`s! :tada:\r\n\r\n[Screencast_20260817_182854.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c7bef12-239c-46d4-847f-48e3a1c00b7f)\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n\r\n- Movement, resizing, rotation, scaling, and pivot modification of `CanvasItem`s, together with its own toolbar.\r\n- Full undo/redo support, unified in the editor's undo/redo manager.\r\n- Added the ability to open scenes by double-clicking them in the game. Just like how it's done in the editor.\r\n- Improved remote shortcut handling. Which is now funneled into a single debugger message, and triggers the pressed visual on the buttons.\r\n- Improved mouse cursor updates in the editor. Now they trigger immediately rather than after an action is taken with the mouse again. \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n### Technical\r\n\r\n- This was done by separating the code that handled such operations in the `CanvasItem` editor into its own file, and making both editor and runtime use it.\r\n- The debug icons that appear at runtime are only present on debug mode, meaning that release templates won't contain them, so no increase in size.\r\n- This PR reverts #118312. Due to it being more necessary due to the increase of used space, and also for me being unable to reproduce #115523 currently. If someone can still reproduce that issue, make yourself known.\r\n\r\n### Caveats\r\n\r\n- Manipulating physical objects doesn't really work unless the game is suspended. This is not new, and it used to happen when editing position values via the remote inspector, for example. This could be worked around later own.\r\n- The old behavior that made selecting a `CollisionShape2D` select its `CollisionObject2D` instead is gone. Not only did that differentiate to how it works in the editor, but keeping it would add too much complexity to the code.\r\n\r\n### Wait, what about 3D nodes?\r\n\r\nSee how the line diff indicates **more than 4 thousand lines** changed? For the sake of the reviewers (and my own sanity), this PR is just for `CanvasItem` nodes. This feature will come to 3D later on, **after** this is merged.","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"ht